      "text": "as Nephi1 sits pondering, he is caught away in the Spirit, 1 Ne. 11:1. my heart pondereth the scriptures, 2 Ne. 4:15–16. brethren of Nephi1 ponder what to do after entering the way, 2 Ne. 32:1. Nephi2 ponders upon things the Lord has shown him, Hel. 10:2–3. Christ tells people to ponder upon what he has said, 3 Ne. 17:3. when ye read these things, ponder them in your hearts, Moro. 10:3.",
